  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 13/04/2026, the continuous use of '62-62A Wellington Road North, Hounslow, TW4 7AE' as five self-contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that, on the balance of probabilities, the property at '62-62A Wellington Road North, Hounslow, TW4 7AE' has been used as five separate self-contained flats, including Flats 1 and 2 within No. 62 at ground-floor level, and Flats 1 and 2 at first-floor level and Flat 3 at loft level within No. 62A, for an uninterrupted period of at least four years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). "
  ],
